data.user:
Discover contacts for the account identified by accountId. Resolve the account via crm_account_get, then use Apollo people-search (when apolloFirst=true) or LinkedIn web_search as fallback. Persist each contact via crm_contact_create.
Inputs:
- accountId: {{ accountId }}
- titlePatterns: {{ titlePatterns }}
- maxContacts: {{ maxContacts }}
- apolloFirst: {{ apolloFirst }}
